+| Typography | X/10 | ... |
+| Border/Radius | X/10 | ... |
+| Animations | X/10 | ... |
+| Loading States | X/10 | ... |
+| Premium Alignment | X/10 | ... |
+
+### Violations
+1. 🔴 [category]: [problem] (line X)
+   - Now: `[incorrect]`
+   - Should be: `[correct]`
+
+2. 🟡 [category]: [problem] (line X)
+   - Now: `[incorrect]`
+   - Should be: `[correct]`
+
+### Recommendations
+- [recommendation]
